# Safety default: no real NIM transfer can be initiated in any normal build.
# Do not enable this in public staging or production.
# A dedicated one-time test build may be explicitly authorized by the human
# wallet owner after the recipient, amount and mainnet are independently checked.
# VITE_ENABLE_LIVE_NIM_SEND=smoke_test_human_approved
# Explicit human-verified receiving address, not a secret. REQUIRED for the test build.
# VITE_SMOKE_ALLOW_RECIPIENT=NQ... (provide one real validated recipient address)
# Do not commit any real keys, seed phrases, or credentials.
